<title>SWITZERLAND: Zurich December inflation rises to 0.8 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Zurich December inflation rises to 0.8 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Consumer prices in Zurich, Switzerland's biggest city, rose 0.1 percent in December from the month before for a year-on-year inflation rate of 0.8 percent, the city statistics office said.</p>
<p>				    Dec 1996	Nov 1996	Dec 1996</p>
<p> Monthly CPI index change   +0.1 pct	-0.1 pct	 0.0 pct</p>
<p> Yr/yr inflation		+0.8 pct	+0.7 pct	+1.9 pct</p>
<p> Index (May 1993 = 100)	  103.1	   102.9	   102.2</p>
<p>-- Zurich Newsroom, +41-1-631 7340</p>
</text>
